{"articleNo":"2355","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2355&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-2학기 대학원(산업및교육) 석사과정 지도교수 배정신청서 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.09","hit":"13900","attachments":[{"name":"배정신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2355&attachNo=1961"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><!--StartFragment-->\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"38\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"484\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">대학원 석사과정 지도교수 배정 신청서 제출 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><br></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;2009학년도 후기 대학원(산업 및 교육대학원) 석사과정 신입생은 아래와 같이 지도교수 배정신청서를 해당기간 내에 제출하여주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2009. 11. 16.(월) ~ 11. 18.(수) [3일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 제출대상 : 대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 석사과정 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 제출장소 : 해당학과 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 제출서류 : 지도교수 배정신청서 1부.</span></p>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n</span>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">2009. 11.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">금오공과대학교 대학원(산업 및 교육대학원)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
